From b5fe89b2e06c10310d09553f4f41521e7ac8be68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 15 Jul 2021 09:22:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-44497] gaudi2: ts configuration in preboot

Ts initialization is required to read the temperature value
in preboot.Thermal_v2 code is being integrated for gaudi2,
along with the required platform specific changes.

Ts is reset once preboot execution is complete.

Change-Id: I1dff8aad534268ef3b73c910643a2f7d4e884d42
Signed-off-by: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
---

